---
import HubCitableStats from '../hub/HubCitableStats.astro';
interface Props { data?: any }
const { data } = Astro.props;
---
<div class="mockup-meta-ahorro" set:html={`
<section class="hero"><div class="heroin"><div><div class="crumb">Finanzas personales / Meta de ahorro</div><div class="eyebrow">Del deseo al aporte mensual</div><h1>Convertí tu meta en un plan que puedas sostener</h1><p class="lead">Definí monto y plazo. Te mostramos cuánto separar por mes, qué aporta el rendimiento y cómo cambia la fecha si ajustás el esfuerzo.</p><div class="pills"><span>Aporte necesario</span><span>Rendimiento separado</span><span>Escenarios comparables</span></div></div><div class="scene" aria-label="Frasco con ahorro acumulado"><i class="coin c1">$</i><i class="coin c2">$</i><div class="jar"><div class="savings" id="heroFill"></div><div class="coins"></div><div class="goal" id="heroPct">25%</div></div><div class="tag"><small>Aporte mensual</small><strong id="heroMonthly">$253.000</strong></div></div></div></section>
<section class="tool"><div class="wrap"><div class="sectionhead"><div><div class="kicker">Elegí una meta para empezar</div><h2>¿Para qué estás ahorrando?</h2></div><p>Los casos precargan montos y plazos distintos, pero todos los datos quedan editables.</p></div><div class="cases"><button class="case active" data-case="emergency"><strong>Fondo de emergencia</strong><small>Construir entre 3 y 6 meses de gastos.</small></button><button class="case" data-case="trip"><strong>Viaje</strong><small>Fecha concreta y gasto previsto.</small></button><button class="case" data-case="home"><strong>Anticipo de vivienda</strong><small>Meta grande y plazo largo.</small></button><button class="case" data-case="custom"><strong>Otra meta</strong><small>Monto y fecha personalizados.</small></button></div>
<div class="workspace"><div class="panel form"><h3>Datos de tu objetivo</h3><p class="sub" id="caseCopy">Un fondo de emergencia se construye por etapas; no hace falta completarlo de una vez.</p><div class="fields"><div class="field"><label for="target">Monto objetivo</label><input id="target" type="number" min="1" value="6000000"></div><div class="field"><label for="current">Ya tenés ahorrado</label><input id="current" type="number" min="0" value="1500000"></div><div class="field"><label for="months">Plazo en meses</label><input id="months" type="number" min="1" max="360" value="18"></div><div class="field"><label for="return">Rendimiento anual estimado</label><select id="return"><option value="0">0% · sin rendimiento</option><option value=".1">10%</option><option value=".2" selected>20%</option><option value=".3">30%</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="possible">Aporte mensual posible</label><input id="possible" type="number" min="0" value="250000"></div><div class="field"><label for="income">Ingreso mensual</label><input id="income" type="number" min="0" value="1800000"><small>Solo se usa para medir el esfuerzo.</small></div></div><div class="actions"><button class="primary" id="calculate">Actualizar plan</button><button class="reset" id="reset">Reiniciar</button></div></div>
<aside class="panel result" aria-live="polite"><span class="badge" id="badge">Fondo de emergencia</span><div class="big" id="monthly">$202.000 por mes</div><div class="biglabel" id="status">Tu aporte posible alcanza</div><div class="meters"><div class="meter"><small>Aportes</small><strong id="contributions">$3.636.000</strong></div><div class="meter"><small>Rendimiento</small><strong id="interest">$864.000</strong></div><div class="meter"><small>Esfuerzo</small><strong id="effort">11% del ingreso</strong></div></div><div class="progress"><div class="progress-head"><span id="progressLabel">Ya completaste 25%</span><span id="gap">$4.500.000 pendientes</span></div><div class="track"><span id="progressBar"></span></div><div class="scenarios"><div class="scenario"><small>Más tranquilo</small><strong id="slow">$162.000</strong></div><div class="scenario"><small>Plan sugerido</small><strong id="base">$202.000</strong></div><div class="scenario"><small>Más rápido</small><strong id="fast">$253.000</strong></div></div></div><div class="tip" id="tip">Automatizá el aporte el día que cobrás para que la meta no compita con el gasto del resto del mes.</div></aside></div></div></section>
<section class="guide"><div class="wrap guide-grid"><div><div class="kicker">Para que la meta no se desactualice</div><h2>Separá monto, plazo y moneda</h2><p>Una buena meta define qué querés comprar, en qué moneda cuesta y cuándo revisar el valor.</p></div><div class="checks"><div class="check"><b>Objetivo medible</b><span>Escribí el monto y la fecha; “ahorrar más” no permite construir un plan.</span></div><div class="check"><b>Cuenta separada</b><span>Mantené el ahorro fuera de la cuenta de gastos cotidianos.</span></div><div class="check"><b>Revisión mensual</b><span>Actualizá el precio de la meta y el aporte cuando cambian tus ingresos.</span></div><div class="check"><b>Rendimiento prudente</b><span>No uses una tasa optimista para justificar un aporte demasiado bajo.</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="faq"><div class="wrap"><div class="kicker">Preguntas frecuentes</div><h2>Cuando el plan se cruza con la vida real</h2><div class="faq-item open"><button class="faq-q">¿Qué pasa si un mes no puedo aportar?<span>+</span></button><div class="faq-a">Recalculá el saldo pendiente con los meses restantes. Evitá compensarlo con una cuota imposible al mes siguiente.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">¿El rendimiento está garantizado?<span>+</span></button><div class="faq-a">No. Es un supuesto para explorar escenarios. Ajustalo al instrumento y al riesgo que realmente usarías.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">¿Cuánto del ingreso conviene ahorrar?<span>+</span></button><div class="faq-a">Depende de tus gastos y estabilidad. El porcentaje sirve como alerta de esfuerzo, no como una regla universal.</div></div></div></section>`} />
<script is:inline>
(()=>{const root=document.currentScript.previousElementSibling?.matches('.mockup-meta-ahorro')?document.currentScript.previousElementSibling:document.querySelector('.mockup-meta-ahorro');

(()=>{const $=s=>root.querySelector(s),$$=s=>[...root.querySelectorAll(s)],money=n=>"$"+Math.round(n).toLocaleString("es-AR");let active="emergency";const presets={emergency:[6000000,1500000,18,.2,250000,1800000,"Un fondo de emergencia se construye por etapas; no hace falta completarlo de una vez."],trip:[4500000,900000,12,.1,300000,1800000,"La fecha del viaje vuelve visible cuánto necesitás reservar cada mes."],home:[45000000,8000000,60,.2,500000,2500000,"Una meta grande necesita revisar monto, moneda y plazo con frecuencia."],custom:[3000000,400000,10,0,250000,1600000,"Definí tu propio monto y una fecha concreta para convertirlo en plan."]};function required(target,current,n,r){const m=r/12;if(!m)return Math.max(0,(target-current)/n);const grown=current*Math.pow(1+m,n);return Math.max(0,(target-grown)*m/(Math.pow(1+m,n)-1))}function calculate(){const target=+$("#target").value,current=+$("#current").value,n=Math.max(1,+$("#months").value),r=+$("#return").value,possible=+$("#possible").value,income=+$("#income").value,req=required(target,current,n,r),m=r/12,futureCurrent=current*Math.pow(1+m,n),futureContrib=req*(m?(Math.pow(1+m,n)-1)/m:n),contrib=req*n,interest=Math.max(0,futureCurrent+futureContrib-current-contrib),pct=Math.min(100,current/target*100),enough=possible>=req;$("#monthly").textContent=money(req)+" por mes";$("#heroMonthly").textContent=money(req);$("#status").textContent=enough?"Tu aporte posible alcanza":"Te faltan "+money(req-possible)+" por mes";$("#contributions").textContent=money(contrib);$("#interest").textContent=money(interest);$("#effort").textContent=(income?Math.round(req/income*100):0)+"% del ingreso";$("#progressLabel").textContent="Ya completaste "+Math.round(pct)+"%";$("#heroPct").textContent=Math.round(pct)+"%";$("#heroFill").style.height=Math.max(8,pct)+"%";$("#gap").textContent=money(Math.max(0,target-current))+" pendientes";$("#progressBar").style.width=pct+"%";$("#slow").textContent=money(req*.8);$("#base").textContent=money(req);$("#fast").textContent=money(req*1.25);$("#tip").textContent=enough?"Automatizá el aporte el día que cobrás para que la meta no compita con el gasto del resto del mes.":"Podés extender el plazo, bajar la meta o encontrar un aporte adicional sin comprometer gastos esenciales."}
$$("[data-case]").forEach(b=>b.addEventListener("click",()=>{active=b.dataset.case;const p=presets[active];["target","current","months","return","possible","income"].forEach((id,i)=>$("#"+id).value=p[i]<1&&p[i]>0?String(p[i]).replace(/^0/,""):String(p[i]));$("#caseCopy").textContent=p[6];$("#badge").textContent=b.querySelector("strong").textContent;$$("[data-case]").forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle("active",x===b));calculate()}));$$("input,select").forEach(x=>x.addEventListener("input",calculate));$("#calculate").addEventListener("click",calculate);$("#reset").addEventListener("click",()=>$("[data-case=emergency]").click());$$(".faq-q").forEach(q=>q.addEventListener("click",()=>q.parentElement.classList.toggle("open")));calculate()})();

})();
</script>
<style is:global>

.mockup-meta-ahorro{--blue:#174b7a;--blue2:#39809f;--ink:#172335;--muted:#606d7d;--line:#d9e2e5;--cream:#fff8e7;--green:#2b7961;--mint:#d7eee4;--gold:#dca943;--sky:#eaf5f8}.mockup-meta-ahorro *{box-sizing:border-box}.mockup-meta-ahorro{margin:0;font:16px/1.45 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:#fbfdfc}.mockup-meta-ahorro button,.mockup-meta-ahorro input,.mockup-meta-ahorro select{font:inherit}.mockup-meta-ahorro .head{height:74px;padding:0 max(24px,calc((100% - 1180px)/2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;background:white;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.mockup-meta-ahorro .brand{font-size:19px;font-weight:900}.mockup-meta-ahorro .brand b{display:inline-grid;place-items:center;width:36px;height:36px;margin-right:10px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--blue);color:white}.mockup-meta-ahorro .nav{display:flex;gap:28px;color:#4e5967;font-size:14px;font-weight:750}.mockup-meta-ahorro .search{padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;background:white}.mockup-meta-ahorro .hero{padding:55px 24px 62px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#fafdfb 0 64%,#e7f3ec 64%)}.mockup-meta-ahorro .heroin{max-width:1180px;margin:auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:55px;align-items:center}.mockup-meta-ahorro .crumb{font-size:14px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:850}.mockup-meta-ahorro .eyebrow{margin-top:27px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--green);font-size:12px;font-weight:900}.mockup-meta-ahorro .hero h1{font-size:clamp(43px,5vw,68px);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:10px 0 20px;max-width:700px}.mockup-meta-ahorro .lead{font-size:19px;color:var(--muted);max-width:650px}.mockup-meta-ahorro .pills{display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:24px}.mockup-meta-ahorro .pills span{padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;background:white;font-size:13px;font-weight:800}.mockup-meta-ahorro .scene{min-height:340px;position:relative}.mockup-meta-ahorro .jar{position:absolute;width:240px;height:255px;left:50%;bottom:24px;transform:translateX(-50%);border:10px solid var(--blue);border-radius:38px 38px 75px 75px;background:#eaf6f5;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 24px 38px #173e5025}.mockup-meta-ahorro .jar:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:34px;right:34px;top:-10px;height:37px;background:var(--blue);border-radius:0 0 13px 13px}.mockup-meta-ahorro .savings{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;height:42%;background:linear-gradient(#f2c763,#dba83c);transition:.3s}.mockup-meta-ahorro .coins{position:absolute;left:22px;right:22px;bottom:12px;height:80px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,#f4d37e 0 12px,#bd8c2e 13px 16px);border-radius:50% 50% 12px 12px}.mockup-meta-ahorro .goal{position:absolute;left:50%;top:90px;transform:translateX(-50%);z-index:2;color:var(--blue);font-size:29px;font-weight:950}.mockup-meta-ahorro .coin{position:absolute;width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gold);border:7px solid #f6d781;color:#78581d;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:950;box-shadow:0 10px 18px #674d2224}.mockup-meta-ahorro .c1{left:10%;top:50px;transform:rotate(-13deg)}.mockup-meta-ahorro .c2{right:8%;top:28px;transform:rotate(11deg)}.mockup-meta-ahorro .tag{position:absolute;right:0;bottom:38px;padding:12px 15px;background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:13px;box-shadow:0 12px 25px #24433718}.mockup-meta-ahorro .tag small{display:block;color:var(--muted)}.mockup-meta-ahorro .tag strong{font-size:21px;color:var(--green)}
.mockup-meta-ahorro .tool{padding:65px 24px}.mockup-meta-ahorro .wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:auto}.mockup-meta-ahorro .sectionhead{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:30px;margin-bottom:23px}.mockup-meta-ahorro .kicker{text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--green);font-size:12px;font-weight:900}.mockup-meta-ahorro .sectionhead h2,.mockup-meta-ahorro .guide h2,.mockup-meta-ahorro .faq h2{font-size:37px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:8px 0}.mockup-meta-ahorro .sectionhead p{max-width:510px;color:var(--muted);margin:0}.mockup-meta-ahorro .cases{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin-bottom:22px}.mockup-meta-ahorro .case{min-height:106px;padding:17px;text-align:left;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:17px;background:white;color:var(--ink);cursor:pointer}.mockup-meta-ahorro .case strong{display:block;margin-bottom:5px}.mockup-meta-ahorro .case small{color:var(--muted)}.mockup-meta-ahorro .case.active{border:2px solid var(--green);padding:16px;background:#f4fbf7;box-shadow:0 9px 22px #2d705a12}.mockup-meta-ahorro .workspace{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.1fr;gap:20px}.mockup-meta-ahorro .panel{padding:28px;border-radius:24px}.mockup-meta-ahorro .form{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:0 16px 40px #17364a0d}.mockup-meta-ahorro .panel h3{font-size:21px;margin:0 0 5px}.mockup-meta-ahorro .sub{margin:0 0 22px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}.mockup-meta-ahorro .fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}.mockup-meta-ahorro .field.full{grid-column:1/-1}.mockup-meta-ahorro .field label{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:850;margin-bottom:7px}.mockup-meta-ahorro .field small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-top:6px}.mockup-meta-ahorro input,.mockup-meta-ahorro select{width:100%;min-height:50px;border:1px solid #d0dadd;border-radius:12px;background:white;padding:12px 14px;color:var(--ink)}.mockup-meta-ahorro .actions{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:22px}.mockup-meta-ahorro .primary{flex:1;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--blue);color:white;padding:14px;font-weight:900;cursor:pointer}.mockup-meta-ahorro .reset{border:1px solid var(--gold);border-radius:12px;background:white;color:#6b5120;padding:13px 17px;font-weight:850;cursor:pointer}.mockup-meta-ahorro .result{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(140deg,var(--blue),var(--blue2));color:white}.mockup-meta-ahorro .result:after{content:"";position:absolute;width:250px;height:250px;border:46px solid #ffffff0b;border-radius:50%;right:-130px;bottom:-120px}.mockup-meta-ahorro .badge{display:inline-block;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--mint);color:#184f40;font-size:12px;font-weight:900}.mockup-meta-ahorro .big{font-size:47px;line-height:1;font-weight:950;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:14px 0 3px}.mockup-meta-ahorro .biglabel{color:#dfedf2;font-size:14px}.mockup-meta-ahorro .meters{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:9px;margin:20px 0}.mockup-meta-ahorro .meter{position:relative;z-index:1;padding:13px;border:1px solid #ffffff2c;background:#ffffff0e;border-radius:14px}.mockup-meta-ahorro .meter small{display:block;color:#dcebf1;font-size:11px}.mockup-meta-ahorro .meter strong{font-size:17px}.mockup-meta-ahorro .progress{position:relative;z-index:1;padding:15px;border:1px solid #ffffff28;background:#ffffff0f;border-radius:15px}.mockup-meta-ahorro .progress-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:13px;font-weight:800}.mockup-meta-ahorro .track{height:12px;margin:12px 0 8px;border-radius:20px;background:#ffffff2c;overflow:hidden}.mockup-meta-ahorro .track span{display:block;height:100%;width:40%;border-radius:20px;background:#f0c361}.mockup-meta-ahorro .scenarios{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:7px;margin-top:13px}.mockup-meta-ahorro .scenario{padding:9px;border-radius:10px;background:#ffffff0d;text-align:center}.mockup-meta-ahorro .scenario small{display:block;color:#dcebf1}.mockup-meta-ahorro .scenario strong{font-size:13px}.mockup-meta-ahorro .tip{position:relative;z-index:1;margin-top:15px;padding:13px 15px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--cream);color:#58482d;font-size:13px;font-weight:750}.mockup-meta-ahorro .guide{padding:70px 24px;background:#f2f7f5}.mockup-meta-ahorro .guide-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.75fr 1.25fr;gap:44px}.mockup-meta-ahorro .guide p{color:var(--muted)}.mockup-meta-ahorro .checks{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}.mockup-meta-ahorro .check{padding:18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;background:white}.mockup-meta-ahorro .check b{display:block;color:var(--green);margin-bottom:5px}.mockup-meta-ahorro .check span{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}.mockup-meta-ahorro .faq{padding:70px 24px}.mockup-meta-ahorro .faq-item{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.mockup-meta-ahorro .faq-q{width:100%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:18px 0;border:0;background:none;text-align:left;color:var(--ink);font-weight:850;cursor:pointer}.mockup-meta-ahorro .faq-a{display:none;padding:0 0 20px;color:var(--muted);max-width:820px}.mockup-meta-ahorro .faq-item.open .faq-a{display:block}.mockup-meta-ahorro .foot{padding:30px;text-align:center;border-top:1px solid var(--line);background:white;color:var(--muted)}@media(max-width:870px){.mockup-meta-ahorro .nav{display:none}.mockup-meta-ahorro .heroin,.mockup-meta-ahorro .workspace,.mockup-meta-ahorro .guide-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mockup-meta-ahorro .cases{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.mockup-meta-ahorro .sectionhead{flex-direction:column;align-items:start}}@media(max-width:540px){.mockup-meta-ahorro .cases,.mockup-meta-ahorro .fields,.mockup-meta-ahorro .checks,.mockup-meta-ahorro .meters,.mockup-meta-ahorro .scenarios{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mockup-meta-ahorro .hero h1{font-size:44px}.mockup-meta-ahorro .actions{flex-direction:column}}

.mockup-meta-ahorro { width:100%; overflow:hidden; }
.mockup-meta-ahorro .top, .mockup-meta-ahorro header.top { display:none !important; }
.mockup-meta-ahorro .foot { display:none !important; }
.mockup-meta-ahorro .support-real { width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 40px)); margin:auto; padding:64px 0; }
.mockup-meta-ahorro .support-real-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr; gap:30px; }
.mockup-meta-ahorro .support-real details { border-bottom:1px solid #dfe6ed; padding:14px 0; }
.mockup-meta-ahorro .support-real summary { cursor:pointer; font-weight:750; }
.mockup-meta-ahorro .support-real p { color:#52657b; line-height:1.65; }
/* Prevent the legacy site's global typography palette from overriding text
   designed to inherit a light color inside dark mockup surfaces. */
.mockup-meta-ahorro :where(h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6,p,span,strong,b,small,em,i,a,label,button,summary,li,th,td) { color:inherit; }
.mockup-meta-ahorro input[type="number"] { -moz-appearance:textfield; appearance:textfield; }
.mockup-meta-ahorro input[type="number"]::-webkit-inner-spin-button, .mockup-meta-ahorro input[type="number"]::-webkit-outer-spin-button { -webkit-appearance:none; margin:0; }
@media(max-width:800px){.mockup-meta-ahorro .support-real-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
{data && <><HubCitableStats data={data} /><section class="mockup-meta-ahorro support-real"><div class="support-real-grid"><div><h2>Preguntas frecuentes</h2>{data.faq?.map((f:any,i:number)=><details open={i===0}><summary>{f.q}</summary><p set:html={f.a}/></details>)}</div><div><h2>Fuentes</h2>{data.sources?.map((s:any)=><a href={s.url} target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">{s.name}</a>)}</div></div></section></>}
